{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "075ad3f3cb97b4d60ef6a915d4666e7e2c49b7e9a097ca78e2ae59ffe345d587", "ja": "（よし、次の現場に移動だ。……ん？\n向こうにいるのは……）", "zh": "（好，转移到下一个现场。……嗯？那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "cc08058d6629c3df0b1a9804cdeb38e42487c32957a327db83eb3f96a9b97974", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ef9b4069f6fbca3e09e28d141c8ae3706299245e0414c42ad864d280e98dfd12", "ja": "お、真。\nどうしたんだ、こんなところで。", "zh": "哦，真。\n你怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3077336b9430f2b3eeffa3ba136a079c2a3771329fba0432b4066d982567080e", "ja": "明日の撮影のために気合いを入れようと思って、\n走り込みしてたんです。", "zh": "我是想为明天的拍摄打起精神，所以来跑步训练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d6400a369e29063ce149f3900fb70d371e29cfe0fa19029587be87c6b7bfc4d7", "ja": "そうか。明日はPV撮影だもんな。でも、あまり\n無理するなよ？　明日に響くといけないから。", "zh": "这样啊。明天要拍PV嘛。不过，也别太勉强自己了。要是影响到明天就不好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "da2039eb232936406f043b9df6ca0a28a898be5a11ec6a5e3eee91d998c57db6", "ja": "わかってますって！　{$P$}は\nこれからお仕事ですか？", "zh": "知道啦！{$P$}先生接下来要去工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aa4b7ff0494bbb8b4dc6e96409a65fdbb9da325ffea222d523398c721f8dc797", "ja": "ああ、次の現場にな。\nまだ時間があるから、ゆっくり歩いていこうかと。", "zh": "啊，要去下一个工作现场。\n时间还早，所以打算慢慢走过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "25eec676483d3f3200a1cde24b5515a5aacbc2dc8202936d535136328ec9d6c7", "ja": "そうなんですね！　あ、それじゃあ……\nえっと、ボクも一緒に歩いていいですか？", "zh": "原来是这样！　啊，那我也……\n那个，我可以和你一起走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d67e428bbc81cd3b338bbcf2316fdb69eb7a473f87ea11380ebdaa1b7c4d580", "ja": "真……。もしかして、何かあったのか？\n相談したいことがあるなら……。", "zh": "真……难道是发生什么事了吗？\n如果有什么想和我商量的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3e19367f10b596831666857c7e52eb4708b926fef38b4c7b4051a3d966b5e81", "ja": "あ、いえ、{$P$}と\n歩いてみたいだけっていうか……。", "zh": "啊，不是啦，只是想和{$P$}\n一起走走，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "5dfd3200785dc85042d6fae03f6a8977ffedbfbc7ffde6c5bc6aaf31b2fb6fee", "ja": "こういうところ、男の人と歩いてみたくて……。\nその、デートみたいでいいな～って。へへっ♪", "zh": "我只是想在这种地方和男孩子一起走走……  \n那个，感觉就像约会一样，挺不错的～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "829ff7406b0a803c3a49b723cace3e49817b1f464e65d87a56d69b3717049053", "ja": "そうか。悩みとかじゃなくて安心したよ。それで真が\n明日の撮影も頑張ってくれたら、もっと安心かな。", "zh": "这样啊。不是烦恼什么的，我就放心了。要是真能让小真也努力完成明天的拍摄，我就更放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "17d1f5ca09629893da63d5935966dc31a55eac9ed194ad010f71415d4b94c7c8", "ja": "ってことは、いいんですか？　やったあ！\nもちろん、撮影は全力で頑張りますよ！", "zh": "这么说，真的可以吗？太好了！  \n当然，我会全力以赴完成拍摄的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "fdb3b99cb7d0f1fedeb270d08cab68ace22c7c4e81e3597f76346c993e3a104f", "ja": "{$P$}のおかげで、気持ちも\nすっごく昂ってきましたから。期待しててくださいね！", "zh": "多亏了{$P$}，我的情绪\n也变得特别高涨了。您就好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1014_null", "source_sha256": "93a0c8fd444656508b3ff9e3fa8c557c8a980d183d4b13dbf843e51794bbdd13", "ja": "そして翌日……", "zh": "然后到了第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eff3a304c0f3fbae4228f55e6ce0463899c6ec59dab0a12ad5d70bff167d1abe", "ja": "……よし、次のシーンで最後だな。\n思いっきり叫んでこい、真！", "zh": "……好，下一个镜头就是最后一幕了。\n去尽情呐喊出来吧，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "81b0bccbe0efc1f8e397b32bc34cc216c4fe65e6607f2c020987a8471b186fae", "ja": "はいっ、任せてください！　ちゃんと届くように\n「好きだー！」って叫んできますから！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！为了让这句话好好传达出去，我会大声喊出“喜欢你——！”的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8a8964e902a843b545f32b69ede0f691aa01d0f316152c2d47910d0993c924da", "ja": "ああ。……ん？　届くようにって、\nまさか、そういう相手がいるのか？", "zh": "啊……嗯？你说要让它传达到，难道说，你有这样的对象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "b2eabfe5df955b4e6ecd898b7d46a2d7af0fb939eec3b3eac0433103dcfed722", "ja": "ちっ、違いますよ！\nえっと、それくらい、心を込めるって意味です！", "zh": "不、不是啦！呃，我是说，要倾注那么多心意的意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "9289431c5880ed636951047392b54b5d3f39e9ec6ce0f4567d6395c1574472cd", "ja": "でも……{$P$}には\n届いてほしい、かな？　なんちゃって。えへへ♪", "zh": "不过……还是希望能传达到{$P$}那里吧？开玩笑的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1020_p", "source_sha256": "18880f69f3c15ea2906a03834da1e518d8a3e12e845daa7336d3bbdb6bb929a1", "ja": "俺に？　それなら心配いらないよ。\nここでちゃんと見てるから。", "zh": "是对我说的吗？那你不用担心。我会在这里好好看着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0234_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "2171ed69e2a4a5718a540b07a4a47ae22a7cc7fb476519cd8369b4b908954685", "ja": "へへっ、そう言われると、緊張しちゃいますけど……。\nボクの告白、絶対聞き逃さないでくださいねっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，被你这么一说，我反而紧张起来了……\n可千万别错过我的告白哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
